{"id":445621971,"author":{"login":"jacob-bd","id":47641890,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjQxODkw","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOQtfMFM4aj6bT","tag_name":"v0.16.5","target_commitish":"main","name":"v0.16.5: cookie file imports prefer .google.com values","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-11-14T22:05:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T22:07:56Z","published_at":"2026-11-14T22:05:47Z","assets":[{"id":748924121,"node_id":"RA_kwDOQtfMFM4so6zZ","name":"notebooklm-mcp-0.16.5.mcpb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":2606,"digest":"sha256:7fafb1d48ef9176bf24f45f09a04d9d6d3c6deb7c895df1da9a455c3e2d8fa58","download_count":71,"created_at":"2026-11-14T22:07:56Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T22:07:56Z"}],"body":"# v0.16.5: cookie file imports prefer `.google.com` values\n\n### Fixed\n\n- `nlm login --file` now prefers the `.google.com` cookie when the same name appears on several Google domains in a Netscape or JSON export. Previously the last entry won, so an \"export all cookies\" file could save the `.youtube.com` values of `SID`, `HSID`, `SSID`, `APISID`, and `SAPISID`. The names were present, so validation passed, and the wrong values were then sent to Gemini Notebook. Imports now use the same domain preference as browser-exported cookies ([#408](https://github.com/jacob-bd/gemini-notebook-mcp-cli/issues/408), [#409](https://github.com/jacob-bd/gemini-notebook-mcp-cli/pull/409)).\n\n### Credits\n\nThanks to @goranai for the precise reproduction and the fix with regression tests in #409.\n","mentions_count":1}
